=== AVX-512 f32 / c32 (L = 16 lanes/register, 32 registers) ===

`live` is accumulators + A plane(s) + broadcasts; `!` marks a shape over budget,
which is `live >= regs`, not `live > regs`: **measured on AVX2** (Phase 4 part 11,
A30) every `live == 16` shape collapses to 21-33 GF/s beside a 48-53 GF/s sibling
at `live <= 15`, so one register is not available to the shape. Verified on AVX2
only -- the AVX-512 sweep predates this column -- and flagged the conservative way.

